[Section: 8. Testing]

No authored automated tests.

The console output is the only apparent behavioral feedback.

[Section: 24. Testing / verification — expanded]

No automated verification exists, but this repository would particularly benefit from state-machine tests.

Missing verification dimensions include:

- sender-window never exceeding configured size;

- sequence wraparound correctness;

- cumulative ACK advancement;

- timeout retransmission starting at oldest unacknowledged frame;

- duplicate/out-of-order frame handling;

- loss/error trace replay;

- deterministic seeds;

- compile validation.

A small table-driven trace harness could have materially increased evidence strength without requiring real sockets.

